            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CROWCHICK"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So, I boiled the ham, which made it really tender. I was surprised. But the sauce wasn't really my cup of tea. It was certainly edible, but it really tasted like the three ingredients did not meld in any way. And it reminded be of barbecue sauce. My husband seemed to like it, the kids ate it... it was okay.",
